    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the centre of the popular town of Louisburgh, this spacious two-bedroom apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation with attractive views over the river and local GAA grounds. While the property would benefit from some cosmetic updating and modernisation, it provides an excellent opportunity for purchasers to add their own style and create a comfortable home, holiday retreat, or investment property.\r\nThe apartment, all conveniently laid out over one floor, is accessed through a welcoming entrance with practical non-slip tiled flooring, while an external decked storage area provides useful space for bicycles, outdoor equipment, or general household storage.\r\nInside, the entrance hallway leads to a generously sized shelved hot press, offering excellent storage. The fully tiled bathroom is fitted with a shower and provides a practical, low-maintenance space.\r\nThere are two generous double bedrooms, both featuring timber flooring and overlooking the quiet internal courtyard, creating bright and peaceful sleeping accommodation.\r\nThe spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area form the heart of the home. Large windows allow plenty of natural light to fill the room, while a sliding patio door frames pleasant views across the river and the local GAA grounds. The generous proportions of this living space provide an excellent canvas for updating to suit individual tastes.\r\nA separate utility room offers additional practicality, complete with tiled flooring, fitted worktop space, and plumbing for both a washing machine and tumble dryer, keeping laundry facilities separate from the main living area.\r\nOffering spacious accommodation, an excellent town-centre location, and considerable potential for cosmetic improvement, this apartment represents an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, holiday home purchasers, or investors seeking a property they can personalise while enjoying everything Louisburgh has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tConveniently located within easy walking distance of all local amenities and services\r\n\tEnjoying stunning views overlooking the picturesque Bunowen River\r\n\tAmple parking is available in the courtyard to the front of the property\r\n\tAn ideal choice for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or purchasers seeking a holiday retreat\r\n\tAn excellent investment opportunity with strong potential for both short-term holiday letting and long-term rental income"
      },
      {
